<task id="019" project="unified-access-control-r2">
  <metadata>
    <title>FR-17b (A-22): Fix LookupUserMembershipNodeExecutor's ["*"] IncludeRelated argument</title>
    <phase>0 Enforcement Remediation</phase>
    <gate>after-001</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Modifies .cs on a membership-resolution consumer (AI node executor) that currently throws at runtime — FULL per root CLAUDE.md §8 (modifies .cs; bff-api tag).</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>A single precisely-diagnosed defect (passing ["*"] under a stale accepts-but-ignores comment) with the correct resolver contract known; contained fix.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>P0-B</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Modifies only Services/Ai/Nodes/LookupUserMembershipNodeExecutor.cs — NOT a contended directory and touched by no other Phase 0 task. File-disjoint from its P0-B partner task 014 (Infrastructure/Caching/CachedAccessDataSource.cs); both depend only on 001 and can run concurrently.</parallel-reason>
    <deps>001</deps>
    <tags>bff-api, ai, refactoring</tags>
    <estimated-effort>2 hours</estimated-effort>
